  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia: Improving Access to Legal and Social Services for Women Facing Violence in Papua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a goal to contribute to longer-term preventative efforts to eliminate VAW (EVAW) in Papua, the Activity will strengthen customary and legal frameworks to protect women facing violence; strengthen government capacity to provide inclusive services for women facing violence; and strengthen civil society organisations&apos; role as catalysts to promote access to legal and social services for women facing violence.</narrative>
  </description>
